  "root_cause": "Uncalibrated 4-quadrant LOQO concatenates raw predict_proba outputs from 4 distinct out-of-quadrant classifiers across severe Great Basin tectonic covariate shift (e.g. NE Humboldt/Owyhee interior has far lower GPS geod_shearrate/geod_2ndinv and lower mapped fault prior 8.76 per 1000 px vs SW Walker Lane 14.37 per 1000 px), causing global top-K dot selection to starve NE (0.1%-0.7% of dots in BLINDFAULT; 11.1%-11.2% in COULOMBLOQO/EULERFUSE across 27.6% of the footprint) while over-crowding SW scarps (38.5%-52.6%, driving >70% sparse overlap with GEMSDOE23/GEMSDOE52)."
